    "description": "Requests for the Hotel Offer Orchestrator assessment: health check, the two mock supplier endpoints, and the main /api/hotels endpoint (city, price-range filtering, and a no-results city). Uses {{baseUrl}} \u2014 set it to http://localhost:3000 for a local run or the docker-compose-exposed API port.",
